## Quick Reference

| Aspect | MasterDataEntity | AuditableEntity |
|--------|------------------|-----------------|
| **Base Class** | `MasterDataEntity` | `AuditableEntity` |
| **Repository** | `MasterBaseRepository` | `BaseRepository` |
| **Create** | `create(data)` | `create(data, context)` |
| **Update** | `update(id, data)` | `update(id, data, context)` |
| **Delete** | `delete(id, { deletedUserId? })` | `delete(id, context)` |
| **Fields** | `createdDate`, `updatedDate`, `version` | `createdUserId`, `updatedUserId`, `createdDate`, `updatedDate`, `version` |
| **Service Param** | No context | Context required |
| **Cleanup** | Soft delete SQL (preserve system data) | Filter by `createdUserId` |
